+| the single code points | ऩऱऴ (`U+0929 U+0931 U+0934`) | asis | `C7 D0 D2 E9` | `_nza_rralvrza` | ऩऱऴ (`U+0929 U+0931 U+0933 U+093C`) |
+|  |  | nfc | `C7 D0 D2 E9` | `_nza_rralvrza` | ऩऱऴ (`U+0929 U+0931 U+0934`) |
